Comment: 50,0:23:24.97,0:23:25.01,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Prévia}
Dialogue: 50,0:00:06.36,0:00:09.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Convidou a Tomori para a sua banda?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:09.61,0:00:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,É, convidei. E daí?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:12.20,0:00:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Escuta, esse seu jeito de falar...
Dialogue: 50,0:00:16.33,0:00:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Você é horrível.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Foi você quem veio pra cima.
Dialogue: 50,0:00:21.88,0:00:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 50,0:00:26.13,0:00:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:33.83,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 50,0:00:37.19,0:00:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi nada.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:26.86,0:02:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:27.93,0:02:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Parece estar com sono.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fiquei até tarde lendo um livro.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:32.74,0:02:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:33.74,0:02:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.17,0:02:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consegui me encontrar com a Taki-chan ontem.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:42.44,0:02:44.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A Saki-chan respondeu?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:48.34,0:02:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.44,0:02:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenham um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:50.60,0:02:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:53.46,0:02:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Que tal irmos até a casa dela?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:56.59,0:02:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutsumi-chan, sabe o endereço dela, não é?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.52,0:03:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ficaria muito feliz se me dissesse.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.06,0:03:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou tentar falar com ela mais uma vez.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:11.46,0:03:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.74,0:03:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.63,0:03:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.53,0:03:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.93,0:03:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.73,0:03:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.14,0:03:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ah... tá deprimida.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.65,0:03:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.25,0:03:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Pinguins, de novo!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.20,0:03:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.57,0:03:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,É um pinguim-de-barbicha.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.77,0:03:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,É tão fofinho.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:44.97,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse que faziam parte de uma série, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.96,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu te dou.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.81,0:03:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:50.41,0:03:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda tenho os que me deu ontem.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.46,0:03:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:55.59,0:03:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Anon-chan! Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.88,0:03:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:57.68,0:03:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia, Tomori-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.47,0:04:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.60,0:04:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou aceitar. Obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.11,0:04:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi o que pensei.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.05,0:04:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquela parte?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.00,0:04:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi hilária, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:15.34,0:04:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois é!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.36,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchau, Tomori-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.54,0:04:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchau.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.49,0:04:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Falando nisso, passou no RiNG?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.62,0:04:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda não.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:26.36,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos ensaiar em um estúdio hoje.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.69,0:04:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.73,0:04:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Vem com a gente!
Comment: 50,0:04:31.00,0:04:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.32,0:04:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,É difícil entrar em locais pela primeira vez, não é?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.83,0:04:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro, mas...
Dialogue: 50,0:04:39.39,0:04:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Sabia que era o mesmo lugar onde arrumei briga ontem.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.39,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Poderão usar este a partir da próxima.
Comment: 50,0:04:44.18,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo bem o usarmos?
Dialogue: 50,0:04:43.25,0:04:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Estaremos no estúdio.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.26,0:04:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Se acontecer alguma coisa, dá um toque.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:45.78,0:04:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Não tem problema.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.06,0:04:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada! Ensaiem bastante.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.67,0:04:50.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Tchauzinho.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.81,0:04:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem ninguém procurando guitarrista e vocalista.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou pra casa.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.66,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, muito obrigada por ontem.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.82,0:05:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Perguntou se eu estava bem, lembra?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.21,0:05:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fiquei sem saber o que fazer depois que ela veio gritar comigo.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi isso?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:20.32,0:05:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas não acho que ela tenha feito por mal.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:22.84,0:05:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Droga!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:24.78,0:05:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Não imaginei que elas se conhecessem.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:28.47,0:05:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Meio que sinto muito por falar mal da sua amiga.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se preocupe.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:33.31,0:05:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,É normal ficar surpresa quando alguém fala com você daquele jeito de repente.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:37.10,0:05:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pois é...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:40.56,0:05:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Está procurando membros para a sua banda?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:42.45,0:05:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Não estava olhando o quadro de recados?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, então, eu estava...
Dialogue: 50,0:05:47.58,0:05:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,É a primeira vez que venho a um lugar assim,
Dialogue: 50,0:05:49.98,0:05:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,e não sei bem como as coisas funcionam.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.21,0:05:53.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.35,0:05:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também não sou muito entendida do assunto.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.59,0:05:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer ir perguntar a um funcionário?
Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não precisa tanto.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, você é da Tsukinomori, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:05.87,0:06:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Aquela escola cheia de garotas ricas!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.75,0:06:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Sim...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:09.12,0:06:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Incrível!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:10.22,0:06:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu ouvi que só filhas de políticos e famosos podiam entrar.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.66,0:06:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem muitas garotas incríveis lá também,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.76,0:06:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,mas estou lá desde o fundamental, então acho que sou normal.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.05,0:06:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Outra coisa, lá vocês dizem mesmo “Tenha um bom dia”?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.74,0:06:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... acho que sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.72,0:06:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:29.16,0:06:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu também fiquei surpresa\N quando ouvi pela primeira vez,
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.09,0:06:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,mas as alunas que estão lá desde a pré-escola falam assim
Dialogue: 50,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,e acho que meio que comecei a imitá-las.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.21,0:06:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Então os rumores são mesmo verdadeiros.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.67,0:06:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,E o rumor de todas irem de carro?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.29,0:06:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que não tem quase ninguém assim.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.09,0:06:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Mesmo? Então...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:48.88,0:06:51.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Só está fazendo perguntas sobre a escola.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.03,0:06:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpa, foi sem querer.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.21,0:06:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 50,0:06:56.48,0:06:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Em vez de ficarmos aqui paradas,\N vamos tomar um chá!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.91,0:07:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindas!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:05.61,0:07:06.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Olá!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.61,0:07:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Quer que eu chame a Taki?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:07.83,0:07:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pode ser depois, por favor.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.87,0:07:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro! Sentem-se onde preferirem.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:18.75,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamem quando tiverem decidido o pedido.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:24.41,0:07:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Recomenda alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:26.38,0:07:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Acho que chá preto.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:27.67,0:07:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,É delicioso. O meu favorito.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:32.15,0:07:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem bastante coisa, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Tem sido bem educada até agora,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:38.27,0:07:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,mas acho que temos a mesma idade, não?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:40.47,0:07:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Está no primeiro ano?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:41.78,0:07:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim, primeiro ano.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:43.50,0:07:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,É tão disciplinada que pensei que fosse mais velha!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:46.39,0:07:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Viu? De novo!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:49.87,0:07:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Posso perguntar o seu nome?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:52.01,0:07:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,O meu é Anon.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:53.75,0:07:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Anon-chan, certo? O meu é Soyo.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.25,0:07:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Incrível!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:57.47,0:08:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Até o seu nome faz parecer de família nobre. Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:00.33,0:08:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Acha mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.59,0:08:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:02.87,0:08:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Como uma senhorita criada em berço de ouro.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Decidiu o que vai pedir?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.66,0:08:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Raana-chan! Veio para o {\i1}open mic{\i0}?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.76,0:08:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ainda não. O que eu escolho?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.84,0:08:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Só um segundinho.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.32,0:08:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Não precisa ter pressa.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.07,0:08:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tá!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Deixa eu ver...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:16.74,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Decidi! Com licença!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.56,0:08:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Já vai!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.14,0:08:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Taki-chan! Atende elas, por favor.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:23.57,0:08:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,É ela...
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.64,0:08:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(\an8)}Tudo pronto, Raana-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:29.30,0:08:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Gostaríamos de fazer o pedido.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:30.77,0:08:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:34.02,0:08:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Veio logo quem eu menos queria ver.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:37.46,0:08:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou querer o de sempre.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.84,0:08:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:39.40,0:08:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, Anon-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:40.36,0:08:41.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O que é o de sempre?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.95,0:08:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Earl Grey, quente.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:43.53,0:08:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maravilhoso! Vou querer o mesmo!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.41,0:08:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela estalou a língua.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.16,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Não foi educado.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:48.18,0:08:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Dois Earl Grey, quentes.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:52.24,0:08:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa encarar assim.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.78,0:08:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse que estava procurando por membros, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:58.88,0:09:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim! Mas...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:00.64,0:09:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dei uma olhada no quadro de recados, mas não encontrei o que procurava.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.66,0:09:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Já tentou pelas redes sociais?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.80,0:09:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Acontece de procurarem gente por lá.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.57,0:09:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Você sabe das coisas, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:14.95,0:09:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,É porque já tive uma.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.17,0:09:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,É meio inesperado alguém da Tsukinomori em uma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.71,0:09:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que é tão incomum assim?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.66,0:09:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah, não brinca com isso.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.01,0:09:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Uma amiga me convidou.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.93,0:09:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tudo pronto.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:24.95,0:09:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Segura aí, o volume tá muito alto.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:25.59,0:09:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Que sorte. Todo mundo no meu colégio está numa banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.85,0:09:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Tudo certo, Raana-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:29.33,0:09:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Então é por isso?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.23,0:09:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso aí!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:47.85,0:09:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Que barulheira.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:49.57,0:09:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, eu...
Dialogue: 50,0:09:51.63,0:09:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Quero cantar e tocar guitarra.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.44,0:09:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,É? Cantar e tocar?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso mesmo!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:21.60,0:10:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Incrível.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:28.49,0:10:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Já deu?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.56,0:10:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Satisfeita.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:45.21,0:10:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Foi incrível, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:47.48,0:10:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu até que não ligaria de deixar\N outra pessoa ficar com a guitarra...
Dialogue: 50,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Mas eu quero muito cantar!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.31,0:10:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Obrigada, Taki-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.35,0:11:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Que falta de educação.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:02.29,0:11:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que brigaram?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:03.84,0:11:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Sei lá. Eu estava falando com uma amiga e ela surgiu do nada.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:07.40,0:11:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Falou coisas como: “O que quer?”, \N“São mesmo amigas?”,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:11.15,0:11:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,“Convidou a Tomori para a sua banda?”
Dialogue: 50,0:11:13.60,0:11:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,e estourou de repente! Eu não entendi nada!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Essa Tomori? Fala da Takamatsu Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.16,0:11:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã? Ah, sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.21,0:11:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Somos da mesma turma.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:24.79,0:11:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ei, conhece ela?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:30.85,0:11:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela é minha amiga.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Entendi.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:36.59,0:11:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ela está na Haneoka.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:40.50,0:11:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito doce!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.68,0:11:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,De onde se conhecem?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:44.71,0:11:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai formar uma banda com a Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.92,0:11:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, ela não quis.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:50.43,0:11:53.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, é mesmo! Você disse que estava em uma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.16,0:11:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Toco baixo.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:54.40,0:11:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tomori-chan mencionou alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.47,0:12:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.27,0:12:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,O quanto sabe tocar baixo?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.42,0:12:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,O básico. Eu toco no clube.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:07.74,0:12:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Então...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.93,0:12:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Apesar de que é meio repentino perguntar...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.05,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer tocar comigo?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.64,0:12:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ué? Sério?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.15,0:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, mas eu gostaria de começar só dando suporte.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:26.80,0:12:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Não tem problema nenhum!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:28.06,0:12:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eba! Te amo, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.73,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,981)}Eba! Te amo, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.77,0:12:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,873)}Eba! Te amo, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.81,0:12:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,733)\1a&H90&\3a&H90&\shad0}Eba! Te amo, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.85,0:12:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,563)\1a&HC0&\3a&HC0&\shad0}Eba! Te amo, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.90,0:12:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,393)\1a&HF0&\3a&HF0&\shad0}Eba! Te amo, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.06,0:12:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, poderia me passar o seu contato?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.94,0:12:34.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.97,0:12:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Muito obrigada.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:41.71,0:12:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.57,0:12:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Então a Tomori-chan recusou, é?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:46.59,0:12:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma garota bem delicada...
Dialogue: 50,0:12:58.67,0:13:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,“Conto com você daqui pra frente.” Pronto.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:04.57,0:13:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ainda bem! Acho que vou conseguir formar a banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.30,0:13:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Será que assim consigo recomeçar?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:20.10,0:13:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Como será que ela virou amiga da Soyo-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:25.45,0:13:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\t(2524,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}Mas... sinto muito.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.26,0:13:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,“Delicada...”
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Talvez eu tenha forçado demais.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.73,0:14:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.87,0:14:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.50,0:14:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe por te pressionar a entrar numa banda aquele dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.93,0:14:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Não vou mais insistir. Pode ficar tranquila.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.41,0:14:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:25.51,0:14:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Bom dia!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.54,0:14:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uma guitarra.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:27.77,0:14:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Como foi ontem?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.01,0:14:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Escutem só! Eu encontrei!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.79,0:14:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Incrível!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:32.96,0:14:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Só tenho a baixista ainda, mas escutem:
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.34,0:14:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,ela é da Tsukinomori!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.94,0:14:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.46,0:14:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Incrível!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.83,0:14:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,É uma pessoa muito gentil.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:40.42,0:14:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Quando tomei coragem para perguntar,\N ela aceitou logo de cara!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.63,0:14:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Só você mesmo para conseguir isso!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:46.30,0:14:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,É graças a vocês! Obrigada!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.81,0:15:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,O uniforme daquela garota é da Tsukinomori, não é?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:04.21,0:15:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Parece até uma boneca! É muito fofa!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.30,0:15:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela não é filha daquele Wakaba? O comediante?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:09.93,0:15:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sério?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.75,0:15:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá brincando, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.54,0:15:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu vi na TV!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:13.14,0:15:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Olha lá! Só pode ser!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.28,0:15:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,É mesmo da Tsukinomori!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.27,0:15:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A mãe dela é uma grande atriz, então deve ser super-rica.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.12,0:15:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro que é!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:30.81,0:15:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bem-vindas!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.32,0:15:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que veio sem avisar?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:37.42,0:15:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Porque não me respondeu.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.29,0:15:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lembro de ter dito para não contar a ninguém sobre mim, não?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:44.68,0:15:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu não contei.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:47.08,0:15:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Chamando atenção daquela forma é o mesmo que dizer.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.47,0:15:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Arruinou tudo.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:56.44,0:15:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Isso é bom.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:58.39,0:16:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A Soyo está preocupada.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Disse que queria ir à sua casa.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:02.94,0:16:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Poderia dizer a ela que me mudei?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.75,0:16:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Não consegue desempenhar esse tipo de papel, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:19.05,0:16:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mutsumi.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:21.22,0:16:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Não se transforme em um pombo-correio.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.78,0:16:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Tenha um bom dia.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.28,0:16:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Por que está aqui?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:48.55,0:16:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A Soyo-san me chamou.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Soyo-san!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe a demora.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Nem demorou.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.09,0:16:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tá sendo educada de novo.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:59.96,0:17:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Taki-chan, posso pedir?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.87,0:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,O que vai querer, Anon-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:03.08,0:17:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Fica por sua recomendação.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:04.45,0:17:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bebemos Earl Grey ontem, então hoje pode ser Darjeeling?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.09,0:17:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Claro.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tch.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.03,0:17:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dois Darjeeling, quentes.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:11.61,0:17:13.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dois Darjeeling, quentes.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.81,0:17:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Então, viemos para falar da banda, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.37,0:17:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim. Precisamos decidir a combinação dos instrumentos,
Dialogue: 50,0:17:20.05,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,e pensei que era bom estabelecer os membros.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:22.44,0:17:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu fico com o baixo, certo?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.02,0:17:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Você será a guitarrista.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:25.93,0:17:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eu quero tocar e cantar.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisamos de uma tecladista também.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.84,0:17:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Entendi...
Dialogue: 50,0:17:31.98,0:17:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Já tenho uma ideia de quem pode ser a baterista.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.95,0:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Que foi?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:37.21,0:17:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Vou formar uma banda com a Anon-chan.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.22,0:17:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quer se juntar a nós, Taki-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:40.80,0:17:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.34,0:17:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Não quero.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.99,0:17:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.92,0:17:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:43.51,0:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisamos dela, Soyo-san.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:45.92,0:17:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,E se a Tomori-chan disser que quer?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:50.67,0:17:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela nunca vai aceitar.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.26,0:17:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Por quê?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:53.26,0:17:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ela está machucada.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.91,0:18:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Todas estão.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.72,0:18:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Do que elas estão falando?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.81,0:18:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Soyo-san?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:15.95,0:18:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.40,0:18:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Nós éramos da mesma banda.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.04,0:18:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Se chamava CRYCHIC.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:25.82,0:18:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A Tomori-chan não disse nada, né?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.96,0:18:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, não...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:31.47,0:18:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ficou um pouco grosseiro, mas...
Dialogue: 50,0:18:34.51,0:18:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Todas estão prontas?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.23,0:18:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar cortada, Mutsumi-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Venha um pouco mais para a esquerda.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.23,0:18:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Precisa agir como se estivesse no centro.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.06,0:18:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Certo, tudo pronto.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.26,0:18:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,E você, Taki-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:49.59,0:18:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tudo certo.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:50.63,0:18:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.53,0:18:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai ficar bem?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.29,0:18:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomori, quer beber um pouco de água?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.78,0:18:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.05,0:19:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Não precisa cantar tudo certinho.\N É só transmitir o que está sentindo.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.17,0:19:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Transmitir?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:05.53,0:19:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Vai dar certo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.87,0:19:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Se errar, é só gravarmos de novo!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:08.90,0:19:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Só consigo tocar a sério uma vez.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.70,0:19:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Poxa, Taki-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.07,0:19:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Você consegue, Tomori-chan!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:16.21,0:19:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Sim.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.67,0:19:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Somos a CRYCHIC.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.28,0:19:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Vamos tocar “Haruhikage”.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.88,0:19:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Quando ligamos estas três estrelas com uma linha,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.13,0:20:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}forma-se um grande triângulo.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:00.09,0:20:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ele é conhecido como Triângulo de Verão.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.99,0:20:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Na verdade, Hikoboshi e Orihime, que todos conhecem do Tanabata,
Dialogue: 50,0:20:08.93,0:20:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}referem-se a Altair e Vega.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:12.32,0:20:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}No Japão, elas são visíveis da primavera ao outono.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.07,0:20:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mas o começo de agosto, a data original do Tanabata, é a melhor época para observá-las.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.91,0:20:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Assim termina a programação de hoje.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.34,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aproveitaram a viagem?
Dialogue: 50,0:20:38.24,0:20:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Atenção aos desníveis ao sair.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:19.60,0:21:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Desculpe por te chamar de repente.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.51,0:21:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Sente-se, sente-se!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:27.89,0:21:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A Soyo-san me contou sobre a CRYCHIC.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.00,0:21:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Você era a vocalista, não era?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.63,0:21:39.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sua voz é incrível.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.38,0:21:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No fundo, será que não quer fazer parte de uma banda?
